  "id": "TN-HB-270-2009",
  "scope": "state:tn",
  "title": "HB 270 (106th General Assembly): As introduced, requires citizenship status to be proven prior to registration to vote and requires certain procedures to ensure identity and citizenship status prior to voting. - Amends TCA Title 2.",
  "urls": [
    "https://legiscan.com/TN/bill/HB0270/2009",
